<title>RUSSIA: Moldova 28-day T-bill yield up, 91-, 273-day down.</title>
<headline>Moldova 28-day T-bill yield up, 91-, 273-day down.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised yield on Moldovan 28-day Treasury bills rose to 25.25 percent on Tuesday from 19.85 percent at the previous auction on November 5, a National Bank official said.</p>
<p>The yield on 91-day T-bills fell to 25.60 percent annual from 26.06 percent.</p>
<p>Nine-month T-bill yields fell to 29.54 percent from 42.22 percent at the previous auction on September 24.</p>
<p>Full details of the 28-day T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Nov 12	  Nov 5</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   3.00 million lei  3.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000	   1,000</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			 2.96 million	7.41 million</p>
<p>    Sold (nominal)			 2.66 million	3.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    25.25 pct     19.85 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    98.1 pct	98.5 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  98.1-98.8 pct 98.5-99.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity date			  Dec 12, 1996  Dec 5, 1996</p>
<p>Full details of the three-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						Nov 12	  Nov 5</p>
<p>    Issue volume			  12.00 million lei 10.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			 1,000	   1,000</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			14.17 million     21.54 million</p>
<p>    Sold (nominal)			12.00 million     10.00 million</p>
<p>    Yield				   25.60 pct     26.06 pct</p>
<p>    Price				   94.0 pct	93.9 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			 94.0-96.0 pct 93.9-95.5 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				Feb 13, 1997  Feb 6, 1997</p>
<p>Full details of the nine-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p>						 Nov 12	  Sept 24</p>
<p>    Issue volume			   2.00 million lei  4.00 million lei</p>
<p>    Denominations			  1,000	   1,000</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			 4.54 million	1.80 million</p>
<p>    Sold (nominal)			 2.00 million	1.29 million</p>
<p>    Yield				    29.54 pct     42.22 pct</p>
<p>    Price				    81.9 pct	76.0 pct</p>
<p>    Range of bids			  81.9-85.0 pct 74.0-80.0 pct</p>
<p>    Maturity				 Aug 14, 1997  June 26, 1997</p>
